.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-key-restore 1  "stool-key-restore "
.SH NAME
stool\-key\-restore \- Validate and manually restore an offline key backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-key\-restore\fR [\fB\-\-gpg\fR] [\fB\-\-ssh\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] <\fB\-\-input\fR> [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate and manually restore an offline key backup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gpg\fR
Only GPG keys
.TP
\fB\-\-ssh\fR
Only SSH keys
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
All available key categories (the default)
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR \fI<INPUT>\fR
Password\-encrypted stool key backup file
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Target user directory (defaults to the current user\*(Aqs home)
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<PASSPHRASE_FILE>\fR
Read the password from a private external file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
